./ I 00110060 $ 00110070 010                                                    
AMODE31  EQU   X'02'          R1 IS A CLEAN 31-BIT VIRTUAL     XA0037DK         
*                             ADDRESS; STRIP BIT 0 ONLY        XA0037DK         
./ I 00168000 $ 00168100 010                                                    
*  ESA/390 DAT CONSTANTS. S/370 PACKS LENGTHS AND FLAGS INTO   XA0037DK         
*  THE HIGH BYTE OF A POINTER, WHICH 24-BIT ADDRESS FORMATION  XA0037DK         
*  IGNORES, SO A PACKED WORD IS USABLE AS AN ADDRESS WITH      XA0037DK         
*  NOTHING TO STRIP. ESA/390 MOVES THEM TO THE LOW BITS --     XA0037DK         
*  STL 25-31, STE FLAGS 26-31, PTE FLAGS 21-22 -- WHICH        XA0037DK         
*  ADDRESS FORMATION NEVER IGNORES. SO EVERY PACKED POINTER    XA0037DK         
*  NEEDS AN EXPLICIT MASK WHERE IT NEEDED NONE, AND AMODE 24   XA0037DK         
*  DOES NOT HELP. I-128. THESE ARE CONSTANTS OVER ARCHITECTED  XA0037DK         
*  WORDS, NOT FIELDS OF ANY STRUCTURE, SO THEY LIVE HERE AND   XA0037DK         
*  NOT IN CORE COPY -- I-143.                                  XA0037DK         
SEGINVAL EQU   X'20'          STE SEGMENT INVALID -- BIT 26    XA0037DK         
PAGINV   EQU   X'04'          PTE PAGE INVALID -- BIT 21       XA0037DK         
PAGINVW  EQU   (PAGINV*256)   PTE INVALID, AS A FULLWORD       XA0037DK         
SEGSTOM  EQU   X'7FFFF000'    STD SEG TABLE ORIGIN 1-19        XA0037DK         
SEGSTLM  EQU   X'0000007F'    STD SEG TABLE LENGTH 25-31       XA0037DK         
SEGPTOM  EQU   X'7FFFFFC0'    STE PAGE TABLE ORIGIN 1-25       XA0037DK         
SEGPTLF  EQU   X'0F'          STE PTL, FULL, AT SEGPTO+3       XA0037DK         
SEGFLGM  EQU   X'0000003F'    STE I, C AND PTL -- NOT PTO      XA0037DK         
PAGPFRM  EQU   X'7FFFF000'    PTE PAGE FRAME ADDR 1-19         XA0037DK         
